    {
      "source": "Optional interface to be implemented by a Spring-managed bean willing to customize how Redis listener endpoints are\nconfigured. Typically used to define the default <a href=\"RedisListenerEndpointRegistrar.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistrar</code></a> or to customize the payload\ntype conversion and validation.",
      "translation": "这是一个可选接口，由希望自定义 Redis 监听器端点配置方式的 Spring 托管 Bean 实现。通常用于定义默认的<a href=\"RedisListenerEndpointRegistrar.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistrar</code></a>，或用于自定义负载类型转换和验证。",
